+
+### FactoryAI Droid startup behavior
+
+- Startup is considered ready when either:
+  - the normal input prompt is visible (`⛬` or `| >`), or
+  - Droid has rendered both startup markers (`ENTER to send` and `Current folder:`).
+- After startup readiness is detected, E2E still waits for the normal prompt before proceeding.
+- In CI, bootstrap also performs a best-effort Droid warmup run to reduce first-session startup flake.

